Template: xroad-common/dataspace-issuer-host
Type: string
Description: Insert dataspace issuer host [default=${DEFAULT}]
 This is the federation-visible name under which this Central Server publishes its dataspace Issuer DID.
 .
 It is often a public hostname or a load balancer name reachable by Security Servers and other federation participants, not necessarily this machine's own hostname.
 .
 Changing this value after credentials have been issued requires re-issuing them.
 .
 Suggested default: ${DEFAULT}
